# Explicit submission path budget: dependency/cache/test outputs below = 0 bytes.
# Deliverables: source/config/docs/artifacts <= 2 MiB; public/assets <= 1 MiB; dist <= 5 MiB.
# Total cap: 8 MiB. The complete production dist/ is deliberately included.
**/node_modules/
**/.cache/
**/.vite/
**/.npm/
**/.npm-cache/
**/npm-cache/
**/coverage/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
/test/scratch/

# Documentation-revision path budget: /artifacts/ <= 1536 KiB;
# /.imd-responses.json <= 4 KiB. Source/config/root docs share the remaining
# 508 KiB of the existing 2 MiB source/config/docs/artifacts allocation.
# Required delivery evidence must remain visible despite local Git excludes.
!/artifacts/
!/artifacts/INTEGRATIONS.md
!/artifacts/VALIDATION.md
!/artifacts/ATTRIBUTION.md
!/artifacts/licenses/
!/artifacts/licenses/*.txt
!/artifacts/licenses/dependency-inventory.json
!/artifacts/evidence/
!/artifacts/evidence/official-sources.json
!/artifacts/evidence/build-and-typecheck.json
!/artifacts/evidence/results/
!/artifacts/evidence/results/*.json
!/artifacts/evidence/screenshots/
!/artifacts/evidence/screenshots/*.png
!/.imd-responses.json
